---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About">
  <section class="section wrap" style="max-width:800px">
    <p class="eyebrow">About Meyo Insights</p>
    <h1>A public record of learning to invest better.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Meyo Insights studies businesses, industries and the principles behind sound investment decisions.</p>
    <p>We ask how businesses earn money, how that cash can grow, what threatens it and whether the market price offers value. We separate reported facts from assumptions, check the evidence and explain our conclusions in ordinary language.</p>
    <p>Kenya and East Africa are our starting point, not our limit. This is educational research, not personalized investment advice.</p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
